      "current_tex": "\\begin{definition}[Closed Set]\\label{def:topological-closed-set}\nLet \\((X,\\tau)\\) be a topological space, and let \\(E\\subseteq X\\).  The set\n\\(E\\) is \\emph{closed in \\(X\\)} if \\(X\\setminus E\\) is open in \\(X\\).\n\\end{definition}",
